<report>
<title>Sample size for paired cohort study</title>

<p>Event rate in control group = <inu>pc</inu><br />
Event rate in experimental group = <inu>ps</inu><br />
Correlation for failure between experimental and control subjects = <inu>r</inu><br />
Alpha = <inu>alpha</inu><br />
Power = <inu>power</inu></p>

<p>Estimated minimum sample size = <in>size</in> pairs</p>
<block name="assumptions">

<p>NB:Assumptions of this calculation may cause over estimation of sample size when power is low.  However, true power associated with <in>cases</in> cases will be no less than <in>no_less</in> and no greater than <in>no_greater</in>.</p>
</block>
</report>
